      "text": {
        "hi": "‘नहीं’ = not. ‘not’ हमेशा am, is, are के बाद आता है: I am not sad.",
        "hinglish": "‘Nahi’ = not. ‘not’ hamesha am, is, are ke baad aata hai: I am not sad.",
        "en": "‘not’ makes a sentence negative. It comes after am, is, are: I am not sad."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "L3.U12.S02",
      "skills": [
        "grammar.not"
      ],
      "text": {
